            "target_entity_instance": "volcanic eruption",
            "target_entity_type": "NaturalHazardType",
            "paragraph": "Analyses of anomalies in CH4 fluxes following the Mount Pinatubo21,51 eruption in 1991 and the record-high El Ni\u00f1o47,52 in 1997\u20131998 are summarized in Supplementary Sections ST4 and ST5.",
