            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "The Amazon drought in 201063 should have resulted in a drop in wetland CH4 emissions, and ongoing analyses may allow researchers to test the hypothesis that tropical wetland CH4 emissions respond strongly to rainfall anomalies and trends.",
